mw2coop patch for maps/so_snowrace_code.gsc (Spec Ops snowmobile races): the console game's split screen.

1. The fog-clear sound is played once in a split screen ("only need to play it on one player then"): both players are on this PC and hear the same speakers, so the second copy is the doubled sound.
@@@ replace
			if ( issplitscreen() )
			{
				// only need to play it on one player then
@@@ with
			if ( issplitscreen() || GetDvarInt( "mw2coop_native_split" ) )
			{
				// only need to play it on one player then
@@@ end
